---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
	title="Privacy policy for okarthur.com"
	sheet="Privacy"
	description="OkArthur's privacy policy. The site collects no personal data. A call booked through Calendly is handled under Calendly's own privacy policy."
>
	<div class="page-head">
		<h1 class="page-title">Privacy</h1>
	</div>

	<div class="prose">
		<p>
			This site collects no personal data. If you email me,
			I use your message only to reply. To ask for your message to be updated
			or deleted, write to <a href="mailto:steven@okarthur.com"
				>steven@okarthur.com</a
			>.
		</p>
		<p>
			The link to book a call opens Calendly, a separate service. If you book
			through it, Calendly collects your name, email address and chosen time
			under <a
				href="https://calendly.com/legal/privacy-notice"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer">its own privacy notice</a
			>. It passes them to me so the call can take place.
		</p>
	</div>
</Base>
